{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e3849108-6bd8-811b-a907-6a63f237e4b8",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T15:31:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela E. Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Beth. My name is Daniela Quintero. I am calling about the city beaches. I would like to know the parking rules at the beach during the off-season."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:29:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing! Which beach were you thinking of? Easton's, Gooseberry, one of the others?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:29:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Easton's Beach, please. I plan to walk there on weekends, and I would like to park legally. Excuse me one moment. My rearview mirror is crooked, and I am fixing it while we talk. I am parked, do not worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:29:49-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, safety first. So, in the winter the beach lots are generally a lot more relaxed. The summer fees and the daily rates usually don't apply once the season is over, but there can still be posted signs about where you can't park or about overnight parking. So read the signs when you pull in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So in the winter, I can park in the lot during the day without paying, as long as I follow the signs. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's generally right, yes. I can't tell you every sign out there, but daytime parking for a walk is usually no problem this time of year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. The mirror is now straight, thank you for waiting. I have one more question. If I go there and the first answer does not work out, for example there is a sign that says something different, what should I do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then the sign wins, honestly. Whatever's posted that day is what they'll enforce. If you're unsure or you get a ticket you think is wrong, call us back here and we'll look into it, or you can call the parking office through City Hall. Just keep a photo of the sign if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:31:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A photo of the sign. That is a precise and useful suggestion. I will do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Enjoy your walks! The beach is beautiful in the winter, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Beth. You were very helpful. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:31:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Daniela. Take care!"
    }
  ],
